*.pyc

# Official raspberrypi/pico-sdk checkout, meant to live outside any one
# project's repo (PICO_SDK_PATH is exactly for this). See CLAUDE.md for
# how to fetch the matching version, once pinned.
pico-sdk

# Copyrighted Saturn-family ROM firmware dumps and the generated C source
# that re-encodes them - not ours to redistribute. Each user must supply
# their own legally-obtained ROM files here; see roms/README.md.
roms/*.ROM
roms/*.rom
roms/rom_images.c

# sim/'s host-file-backed continuous-memory snapshot - local runtime
# state, not source, same treatment as roms/rom_images.c above.
sim/cassini_sim_persist.bin
